**Design rationale summary:**

| Milestone | Rule Type | Why |
|-----------|-----------|-----|
| find dark_oak_button | `position_near_with_facing` | This is a find/locate task — the preferred rule type per guidelines. The button exists in the scene at a known position; the player must navigate near it and face it to "find" it. max_distance=5 keeps it tight since the button is subtle and close to spawn. |
| craft trapdoor | `inventory_has` | This is a craft task — `inventory_has` is the preferred rule type per guidelines. The crafted dark_oak_trapdoor ends up in inventory and is not present at episode start. Checking for ≥1 in inventory is the most reliable confirmation. |

